# Ether (CR 605.3, 603.7b, 707.10): "{T}, Exile this artifact: Add {U}. When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn,
# copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy." On turn 3 Bot1 taps and exiles Ether for {U} and casts Ancestral Recall
# at itself: the copy, retargeted at Bot2, is not cast and resolves first, so Bot2 draws three; the original then draws Bot1 three.
